# POM and API Layer Patterns

## Page objects (`pages/`)

- Extend `BasePage`; routes from `constants/routes.js`
- Locators: prefer `[data-test="..."]`, then stable IDs (`#email`, `#payment-method`)
- Actions return promises; assertions stay in specs or use explicit wait helpers
- Login: `getByRole('button', { name: 'Login' })` — not `input[type=submit]`

## API services (`api/endpoints/`)

- Extend `BaseApiClient` from `api/clients/BaseApiClient.js`
- Endpoints from `constants/api-endpoints.js`
- Auth: pass Bearer token from login response, not hardcoded

## Specs (`tests/`)

- UI specs: import from `fixtures/ui.fixture.js`
- API specs: import from `fixtures/api.fixture.js`
- Test names: `TC-UI-XX` / `TC-API-XX` matching manual CSV traceability
- `beforeEach` for shared login/setup; keep tests independent

## Helpers

- `helpers/ui-auth.helper.js` — `registerAndLogin()`, `loginAsCustomer()`
- `helpers/api.helper.js` — `findInStockProduct()`
- `utils/data-generator.js` — unique email/password for registration
